<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39337" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιεικτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>yielding</i>, 
				Ep.
			 word, in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> always with neg., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σθένος οὐκ
			ἐ</span>. <i>unyielding, dauntless</i> might, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.32
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μένος ἔμπεδον οὐδ᾽ ἐ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.493
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μένος . . ἀάσχετον, οὐκ
			ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.892
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πένθος ἄσχετον, οὐκ ἐ</span>.
				<i>ceaseless</i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.549
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργα γελαστὰ καὶ οὐκ ἐπιεικτά</span> not
				<i>tolerable</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.307
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστέον οὐκ ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.526
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>.
				<i>permissible</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἐπιεικτὰ</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζητῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anon.
					<u>Incred.</u>
					15(14)
				</span></i>
			
			=
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Astr.</u>
				15
			</span></i>: c. dat., <i>befitting</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βροτοῖσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Man.
					6.402
				</span></i>
			.</div>
